at video and it will help you  throughout the process of recording  editing and uploading your video on your  course platform well now that you have  your videos ready to go it is time to  upload them to your course platform and  like i said this video is brought to you  in partnership with thinkific which is a  phenomenal online course platform  thinkific is an online course platform  built to help you create sell and  deliver your online course under your  own brand over 50 000 course creators  from 90 different countries are building  their online education businesses using  thinkific think of it gives you the  tools to build and customize a premium  learning experience that your students  will love  you can process payments and automate an  enrollment into your course without any  hassle and they can help you easily  create a branded course website so you  can confidently launch your online  course entrepreneurs small business  owners and organizations of many  different sizes use thinkific and offer  freed and paid online courses and  memberships in tons of industries they  also have an app store to help you  customize your course business even  further from celebrating your students  milestones with personal animations to  showcasing real-time course purchases  the thinkific app store helps you bring  your teaching vision to life if you are  interested in getting started with  thinkific i will leave all of the  information for the best pricing  possible for you in the description box  below  now that we have your course uploaded to  your course hosting site it is time to  create your sales page now this is  different than a web page because this  sales page has one purpose and one  purpose only and that is to move your  future students from viewing to buying  thinkific makes it so easy for you to  create this sales page where you have  different ways that you can show your  students what is inside and expected in  the course now winning sales pages that  will 