er just a certain amount of people to  get access to it but you want to be  creating that wait list before the  course is created now it's time to  market your course and if you are on  youtube already you already have an  avenue to do this this is through video  creation this is through email sending  there are so many ways you can be  marketing your course online now like i  said if you are already creating youtube  videos you can create those videos and  then just give a call to action that  says if you want to go deeper in this  type of content i have an online course  and you can get that link down in the  description now what i love so much  about using youtube as the marketing  platform is that youtube will work for  you while you snooze meaning that once  you create that video that leads to your  online course if you've done your job  right meaning that you've created a  video that people are interested in that  people are searching for and that people  are finding solutions to their problems  for then you can actually take people  off of youtube and send them right over  to your sales page now depending on the  price of your course i recommend that  you don't actually just sell right on  youtube you want to offer something free  before that so a couple ways that you  can market this is if your course is  under say a thousand dollars you can  offer a free download and then you can  offer them the course now if your course  is over a thousand dollars i recommend  actually doing a webinar you want to  give free value up front before someone  makes that purchase i'll link down below  different resources if you want to learn  how to create a great webinar that can  help you convert your course and now you  are ready to get started i hope that  this free tutorial has helped you on  your course creating journey and if you  decide to join thinkific as your course  hosting platform you'll get access to  their free youtube resource guide this  guide is going to help 